    "title": "riocharts-mcp: an MCP server (stdio) that renders charts as PNG or SVG files for AI agents.",
    "version": "0.1.14-preview",
    "description": "A local MCP server (stdio) that lets AI agents such as Claude Code, Claude Desktop or GitHub Copilot render charts as PNG or SVG files from a JSON spec, with data from CSV and JSON files or inline rows. Install with dotnet tool install -g RioCharts.Mcp and run riocharts-mcp."
